{"id":2383,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><style></style><div><p>&nbsp;为进一步加强班风学风建设，精准掌握学生学习生活与考研就业情况，切实解决同学们的实际困难，2026年4月28日晚，机械工程学院在机械大楼318会议室召开2024级班长、团支书座谈会。院党委副书记李晓杰、辅导员王佳敏以及全体24级班团干部参加会议。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=iLNVD7Lz7inRLYosR-aLRA2nRMVUNVZkM7lio7lPoR7aL490gihFp2hmCIa0nShkLkhfMSyiMmlDL4NanzAfM4NDMlnfMm9DLznVLz9YLzAFL4-iM8CZL8QFLlL8nRUJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0LzU4oky4MRviMYbw62b8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=34757&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/EB0A55656390E8A7965DA68614E18218/3257F83F/1C4D4\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 491px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=iLNVD7Lz7inRLYosR-aLRA2nRMVUNVZkM7lio7lPoR7aL490gihFp2hmCIa0nShkLkhfMSyiMmlDL4NanzAfM4NDMlnfMm9DLznVLz9YLzAFL4-iM8CZL8QFLlL8nRUJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0LzU4oky4MRviMYbw62b8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=34757&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 会上，各班班长、团支书依次发言，既交流了班级学风、课堂考勤、考研就业等整体情况，也分享了班级建设中的亮点做法。与此同时，大家也坦诚反映了当前存在的问题，包括部分课程到课率不均衡、查课效率不高、宿舍管理与课程安排有待优化、考研意向较多但决心不足等，并且提出了务实可行的改进建议。</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp; <img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=inz-DsUNn7MR-Znsmn2Uzffoz-bUNUZbMNnfUNQkoRQ7nlC0gihFp2hmCIa0L1hVoShVL1h7Lz-sUmM7U4ffL49DLlWRU8W7MzMRL8MkL46FL8LsLzWfnRVFozUDMSb/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4L8M4lsgtA8pUbcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=34757&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/2E9E2D127B3DC0A3861BCCBD53C3CB37/3C712AD1/9465\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 487px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=inz-DsUNn7MR-Znsmn2Uzffoz-bUNUZbMNnfUNQkoRQ7nlC0gihFp2hmCIa0L1hVoShVL1h7Lz-sUmM7U4ffL49DLlWRU8W7MzMRL8MkL46FL8LsLzWfnRVFozUDMSb/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4L8M4lsgtA8pUbcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=34757&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>李晓杰老师认真听取大家的发言并作总结讲话。他首先充分肯定各班建设成效，对班团干部的辛勤付出表示感谢。他强调，班团干部是学院联系学生的桥梁纽带，因此要当好“领头雁”，带头严守学习纪律、营造优良学风；还要主动组建考研互助小组，强化朋辈帮扶；更要及时反映同学心声，做好沟通服务。学院将扎实推进“一生一运动”，并对大家提出的问题逐项梳理、尽快落实，全力为同学们成长成才保驾护航。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=iL46DRol-YLNl8Lsm62oznVMRvZo7rZRLmWRU4UPUzCaM490gihFp2hmCIa0LkhVL1yZLkhfU4LDU8UPLRCioR7PnRUaL462Mm-YM4VRolVFUmGPMRnRLRTFLz-sLzNJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0LzU4oky4MRviMYbw62b8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=34757&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0E280AC36CD1065811D4037F62271C9A/B0144C09/12719\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 495px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=iL46DRol-YLNl8Lsm62oznVMRvZo7rZRLmWRU4UPUzCaM490gihFp2hmCIa0LkhVL1yZLkhfU4LDU8UPLRCioR7PnRUaL462Mm-YM4VRolVFUmGPMRnRLRTFLz-sLzNJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0LzU4oky4MRviMYbw62b8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=34757&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; 此次座谈会气氛热烈、务实高效，不仅摸清了真实学情，还凝聚了班级合力。学院将以此次座谈为契机，持续优化学风建设与管理服务，努力营造勤学善思、团结向上的良好氛围，助力学生全面发展。</p><p><br></p><p>一审一校 曹钧翔</p><p>二审二校 王怡宁</p><p>三审三校 李宗霖</p></div></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=iLNVD7Lz7inRLYosR-aLRA2nRMVUNVZkM7lio7lPoR7aL490gihFp2hmCIa0nShkLkhfMSyiMmlDL4NanzAfM4NDMlnfMm9DLznVLz9YLzAFL4-iM8CZL8QFLlL8nRUJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0LzU4oky4MRviMYbw62b8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=34757&e=.jpeg"}